# Copy to `stems.env` for local docker compose. Never commit the real file.
#
# On the VPS goupload-compose.sh makes /opt/goupload/stems.env once (root 0600)
# and keeps it across deploys, like redis.env. Compose hands it to stemsapi,
# which refuses to start without it, and to goupload, which sends it.
#
# 32 to 128 letters or digits, for example the output of: openssl rand -hex 32
STEMS_API_SECRET=
